      "body": "Fixes #4683 (queue task 6665; triaged CONFIRMED by task 6660).\n\n`AbuseEvaluator::budget_usage` is an `&self` read, but `WindowCounter` only rolled on the mutating charge paths (`budget_refusal` / `record_budget`). A charged scope therefore reported its full current-window usage forever until an unrelated charge rolled it — after 2+ windows the true usage is 0 while `budget_usage` still reported the stale full window, even though `check_budget` admission at the same instant correctly succeeded.\n\n## Change (`pkgs/id/src/abuse.rs` only)\n\n- `WindowCounter::rolled(now_ms)`: a copy of the counter with `roll(now_ms)` applied.\n- `estimate_bytes` / `estimate_messages` now estimate from the rolled copy. A second roll at the same `now_ms` is a no-op, so post-roll `can_admit` behavior is identical; write-path roll semantics, the sliding-window weighting, and `budget_usage`'s output shape are unchanged (all outside the packet scope).\n\n## Tests\n\nNew regression test `budget_usage_rolls_the_estimate_on_the_read_path`: two 100B / 1-message charges in a 1000 ms window report `(200, 2)` in-window, `(100, 1)` at t=1500 with no intervening charge, and `(0, 0)` at t=2000 and t=100000, with `check_budget` admission agreeing at t=100000. Existing `pkgs/id` abuse/budget tests run in CI.\n\n<!-- codesmith:footer -->\n---\n<a href=\"https://backend.blacksmith.sh/track/enable-autofix?expires=1796258934&installation_model_id=443529&pr_number=4690&ref=codesmith_pr_footer&repository=developing-today%2Fcode&return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fdeveloping-today%2Fcode%2Fpull%2F4690&signature=17f230ef284a0d2b5fcf31c1b1b7b81e23952f9ddf571e272781fb73fd01f522\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Autofix with [code]smith\" src=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark-3x.png\" width=\"190\" height=\"28\"></picture></a>\n<sup><a href=\"https://app.blacksmith.sh/developing-today/codesmith/code/pr/4690?autoLogin=true&ref=codesmith_pr_footer\">Open in [code]smith</a> · Need help on this PR? Tag <code>@codesmith-bot</code> with what you need.</sup>\n\n<!-- codesmith:autofix:disabled -->\n<!-- /codesmith:footer -->",
